              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngokwezenzo zabo uzabuyisela kubo ulaka kwabamelene layo, lokuphindisela ezitheni zakhe; eziqhingini uyobuyisela isinxephezelo.",
          "type": "text",
